@site School Bad
@title School Bad
@desc A tiny student-made site about surviving school, because sometimes school is just school 💀.
@author Anish
@tags school | student | fun | notes
@lang en
@type blog
@category student
@status active
@version 1.0
@theme night
@icon 🏫

@stylus
  page
    background #0d0d14
    color #f4f4f5
    pad 16
  section
    background #191923
    radius 12
    pad 14
  card
    background #252536
    radius 10

@page School Bad /
  @nav Home / | Survival /survival | Rants /rants
  # School Bad 💀
  @p A harmless little student site for jokes, notes and surviving the school grind.
  @section
    ## The agenda
    @card School Survival /survival
    @card Rants /rants

@page Survival /survival
  @nav Home / | Rants /rants
  # School Survival
  @p Keep it simple: sleep, revise, ask for help when you need it, and don't leave everything until the night before.
  - Keep notes organised
  - Break big chapters into smaller parts
  - Take proper breaks
  - Ask a teacher when something makes no sense

@page Rants /rants
  @nav Home / | Survival /survival
  # Rants
  @p Sometimes the timetable has more plot twists than the actual textbook.
  @p This page is for harmless school humour — no personal attacks, just student suffering 💀.
